2026-09-27,mac,appkit,P73,ok,ok,window,default,"P73-publish-during-build.csv: window reads report: done and running: no after a publish delivered mid-construction. Before the ViewGraphNode guard, P73 --spin died with SIGTRAP 10 launches in 10; --no-spin survived 10 in 10 both before and after."
2026-09-27,ios,uikit,P73,ok,ok,window,default,"P73-publish-during-build.csv: capture reads report: done and running: no. Before the guard the app crashed (debugTarget-2026-09-27-222247.ips, EXC_BREAKPOINT) and the final capture was the home screen, which the sweep then counted as a pass -- sweep_apple.zsh now reads crash reports."
2026-09-27,mac,appkit,P21,ok,ok,window,default,"CORRECTION to this morning's P21 row: the ToggleSwitch is not defective. P21 starts it ON (@State var switchState = true); probed, the click gives onAction state=0, onChange(false), setState false. The readout 'ToggleSwitch style -- false' is the correct result of flipping the enabled switch from true, with the disabled switch refusing input. mistakes.md entry 30."
2026-09-27,mac,appkit,P15-DARK,ok,ok,window,default,"First run against the right app: this morning's sweep replayed P15-DARK's file against P15 (it cut the name at the first dash). Also: test_P15-DARK.zsh waited for a RENDER COMPLETE marker P15-DARK never writes, so every macOS run timed out and took a timeout capture; the marker is removed. Capture: Requested dark, Resolved dark, the button present."
2026-09-27,mac,appkit,P17-DOE,ok,ok,window,default,"First run against the right app, and the first run through test.zsh at all: test_P17-DOE.zsh did not exist, and this morning's sweep replayed P17-DOE's file against P17. Replayed and captured a 760x508 window."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P54,ok,ok,window,default,"P54-pull-to-refresh.csv: capture reads refreshes: 2, rows up to 10. Failed in every earlier sweep of this series with refreshes: 0: RootScrollHost set isScrollEnabled from overflow alone, and .refreshable puts its UIRefreshControl on that host, so a page that fit switched the pull off underneath it. Scrolling now stays enabled while a refreshControl is set."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P50,ok,ok,window,default,"All three files pass after re-measuring: the page now scrolls, so each file first scrolls to the end of the content (the bottom clamp makes the layout repeatable). The Cycle readout's width rewraps the text above it, so rows move 14-22 points between steps and each step was measured from its own capture. arrowEdge top: PANEL ALPHA above its button; bottom: below; beta: PANEL BETA at the second button."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P17,ok,ok,window,default,"P17-picker-and-sizes.csv: the presses trail was off the right edge, and a final rightward scroll brought it into the photograph -- it read S+>: the Longest row had never landed, and the file's VERIFIED LS+> dated from the 2026-09-08 layout. Re-aimed to (410, 367); trail now LS+>, Selected S, Shorter (125), stack 178 x 160."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P17-DOE,ok,ok,window,default,"Assertion inverted: the file said a rightward scroll must NOT reveal B: clipped(), because the root view could not scroll. It can now, so B must come into view clipped; capture shows A and B whole with the orange flush to the blue."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P27,ok,ok,window,default,"P27-scroll-past-the-webview.csv: the 94-point move was measured in a 393 x 852 window. In the 440 x 956 simulator the content ends at about y 830, so the page must not move, and it does not."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,-,ok,ok,window,default,"Full sweep ios-sweep-full4.csv2: 74 of 74 replayed and captured, every capture read. Four had missed taps the sweep counted as passes -- P29 (Enable it), P31 (slider mousedown 60 points above the slider), P46 (Increment model), P65 (both gesture panels) -- all re-aimed and re-run to the asserted state. Not evidenced by the capture, left out of the matrix: P0, P2 (Reset returns to launch values), P22, P24 (pushes recorded stays 0; push then pop ends at Level 0), P5 (iOS shows one alert at a time), P37, P3 (the detail pane is scrolled out of view)."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P0,ok,ok,window,default,"Rewritten: Increment, Reset, Increment, Increment -> 2, read 2 on three runs from a stored 5. The old order ended at the launch value 0. Taps at y 480: the content is centred, and after the first press the event line wraps to two lines and moves the buttons up 12 pt -- at 486 only the first tap landed (five runs read 1..5)."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P2,ok,ok,window,default,"Chocolate then Reset -> Selected: Vanilla, changes: 1 (Reset's write fires onChange). A missed Reset reads Chocolate, a missed Chocolate reads changes 0. P2.swift now counts Always enabled presses in its label: Always enabled (1)."
2026-09-28,mac,appkit,P2,ok,ok,window,default,"The macOS file had been missing since at least 2026-09-27: its y values were 12-17 pt off, the capture read options: 2 with the row disabled, and the sweep counted it a pass. Re-measured from the window-frame capture; now options: 5, row enabled, Always enabled (1), resizing on."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P3,ok,ok,window,default,"Selected detail: C and Image size: Small, scale 1.0x. Those readouts were black on the column's black background (P3.swift now draws them white), and the Small tap had been on Large, the launch size."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P5,ok,ok,window,default,"UIKitBackend fix: showAlert presented from the root view controller, which fails silently while it already presents. A+B+C showed only A and dropped B and C. Alerts now stack on the top of the chain: C on top, OK -> B, OK -> A; stdout lists C dismissed, then B. Same-window half only; the cross-window row stays open."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P22,ok,ok,window,default,"Narrower, Narrower, Wider -> Wrapping at 250pt. The old Narrower+Wider ended at the launch 300pt. At 200pt the paragraph is five lines and the buttons sit 45 pt lower."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P24,ok,ok,window,default,"NOT a defect: Pop to root sets pushCount = 0. Rewritten to end at Level 1, pushes 1, counter 1; stdout (now captured through a pty) shows push recorded at level 2, popped to root, push recorded at level 1. Pushed levels carry a Back bar, so their buttons sit 23 pt lower than the root's. mistakes.md entry 30, second occurrence."
2026-09-28,ios,uikit,P37,ok,ok,window,default,"The drag started at y 846, the bottom edge of the old 852-pt window, and in the 956-pt one it only scrolled the page. From y 950 the app switcher takes the screen with P37 as a card."
2026-09-28,mac,appkit,-,ok,ok,window,default,"Every macOS capture of the 2026-09-28 sweeps read against its file. The 09-27 sweep's 81/81 had counted many misses: y offsets of 12-50 pt (P2, P3, P10, P11, P13, P16, P17, P30, P34, P49, P50 x4), NSMenu content never reached (P19, P20), files ending on the launch state (P0, P4, P12, P15, P22, P23, P27, P35, P38, P41, P59 persistent drafts, P72 context menu). All rewritten and re-run; second full sweep 83 of 83, captures read."
2026-09-28,mac,appkit,P1,ok,ok,window,default,"InputEvent fix: open/save panels draw in another process and in-process events never reached them -- Escape and a click on Cancel were ignored in every capture back to 2026-09-01. Clicks and keys aimed at an NSSavePanel now go through the HID tap (Accessibility grant required, refused loudly without it). Open/Folder/Save all Cancelled; P18 likewise."
