2026-10-16,ios,uikit,P95,ok,n/a,window,default,"iOS/Android comparison: noted -- the third segment of the strip, a LinearGradient of (0.8, 0.3, 0.25) to itself, reads 216 104 88 on iOS where Android and macOS read the swatch colour (colour_bbox --sample; the plain swatch is 200 72 72 in its 8-step bins on all three). UIKitBackend draws the gradient in a different colour space (queue.md item 20). The rest matches; the Android 1-px seam is item 19."
2026-10-16,android,android,P95,ok,n/a,screen,default,"iOS/Android comparison: noted -- the third segment of the strip, a LinearGradient of (0.8, 0.3, 0.25) to itself, reads 216 104 88 on iOS where Android and macOS read the swatch colour (colour_bbox --sample; the plain swatch is 200 72 72 in its 8-step bins on all three). UIKitBackend draws the gradient in a different colour space (queue.md item 20). The rest matches; the Android 1-px seam is item 19."
