2026-10-19,windows,winui,P43,ok,ok,window,default,"Swift 6.4.1, test.zsh -win --no-build --showtime 5 with actions/win/P43-gradient-clipped-to-the-shape.actions, rc=0. Supersedes this morning's defect row: the gradient ring is whole, circle/control/rectangle unchanged. renderPath now grows the Path by the stroke width with a negative margin, so XAML's layout clip no longer cuts the half of the stroke outside the frame."
